                  <span class="ws-dash-eyebrow">Leaders</span>
                  <h2 class="ws-dash-title">Assessment</h2>
                  <p class="ws-dash-sub">Rate a leader against every function on file — admin-only, never shown to the leader being rated. Manage the function list itself from the Settings subtab.</p>
