        <section class="ws-panel" data-panel="sharedcal" hidden>
          <p class="ws-att-hint">One calendar for the whole organization — anyone can add a meeting, deadline, or reminder here, and it shows up the same way no matter which group you're viewing it from. Music's own Event Calendar bookings show up too, as a read-only marker — edit those from Music's own tab instead.</p>
          <div class="ws-subtabs">
