        <button type="button" class="btn-primary" data-curr-day-save>Save &amp; close</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Event Calendar's day view — an agenda of that day's bookings, and
       the add/edit form for one of them at a time (never both shown at
       once). Reuses Curriculum's curr-day-overlay/curr-day-panel shell
       for a consistent look, but is otherwise its own component since a
       day can hold several bookings instead of Curriculum's one. -->
