  <!-- Which occurrences a change applies to — shown for BOTH Save and
       Delete, but only when the entry being acted on actually repeats;
       a one-off entry just saves outright, or gets the plain confirm()
       everything else in the workspace uses for delete. Shared between
       the two (see scOpenScopeChoice()) since the three options and
       their underlying series-split logic are identical either way. -->
  <div class="curr-day-overlay" data-sc-scope-overlay hidden>
    <div class="curr-day-panel ws-sc-custom-panel" data-sc-scope-panel>
      <p class="curr-day-section-label ws-sc-custom-title" data-sc-scope-title>Recurring event</p>
      <div class="ws-sc-end-options">
